@startuml
title SD05 - Follow up prospective customer (AD20 / AD21)
autonumber
actor "Acquisition employee" as Acquisition
participant "visit:AcquisitionVisit" as Visit
participant "prospect:ProspectiveCustomer" as Prospect
actor "Pharmacy contact" as Pharmacy
actor "Sales employee" as Sales
participant "customer:Customer" as Customer
Acquisition -> Visit: recordVisit()
Visit --> Acquisition: visit recorded with date and contact information
Acquisition -> Prospect: Request acquisition overview
activate Prospect
Prospect --> Acquisition: companies without orders visited at least one month ago, contact person and details
deactivate Prospect
note right of Acquisition: Only contacts in this overview are eligible for follow-up.
Acquisition -> Prospect: checkFollowUpAfterOneMonth()
activate Prospect
Prospect -> Prospect: hasPlacedOrder()
Prospect --> Acquisition: eligibility and order status
deactivate Prospect
alt At least one month has elapsed and no order exists
  Acquisition -> Pharmacy: Call and offer 10% extra on first order
  Pharmacy --> Acquisition: interest and permission to create account
  alt Interested and account creation permitted
    Acquisition -> Prospect: offerOneTimeDiscount()
    Prospect --> Acquisition: incentive recorded
    Acquisition -> Sales: Transfer company, billing/delivery addresses and incentive
    Sales -> Prospect: createCustomerAccount()
    activate Prospect
    create participant "newCustomer:Customer" as NewCustomer
    Prospect -> NewCustomer: <<create>>
    note right of NewCustomer: oneTimeDiscountGranted = true
    NewCustomer --> Prospect: customer account created
    Prospect --> Sales: new customer details
    deactivate Prospect
    Sales --> Acquisition: account registration confirmed
  else Not interested or no permission
    note right of Acquisition: Record outcome and close follow-up without more contact.
  end
else Already ordered or follow-up not yet due
  note right of Acquisition: No incentive follow-up required.
end
@enduml
